my current meld [B3,B4,B5] by enabling a shifted sequence like B4-B5-B6 or B5-B6-B7. Conversely, **B8** is isolated and terminal (Bamboo-8 is even, but close to 9), offering minimal connection. Among honors, **J3\u00d72** gives me a chance at a concealed pair or future pung (Dragon Pung = 2 points). **F2** and **F4** are wind tiles, but neither is East (my seat/prevalent), so they offer no wind advantage. **T2** is a safe simple tile, but not urgent to discard.\n\nThus, the weakest tile with least synergy is **B8** \u2014 it doesn\u2019t connect to any sequence and is high-end bamboo with no companion. It\u2019s better to discard B8 now than block development.\n\nAnswer: Play B8"}
